    <content>
      <![CDATA[<div class="note info flat"><p>本文系统梳理 Git 的核心概念与高频命令，覆盖本地仓库、分支管理、远程协作、撤销回滚、合并冲突、Pull Request、Git LFS 与子模块。命令均可直接复制，尖括号 <code>&lt;&gt;</code> 表示需要替换的参数。</p></div><h2 id="一、Git-分区概念"><a href="#一、Git-分区概念" class="headerlink" title="一、Git 分区概念"></a>一、Git 分区概念</h2><p>理解 Git 的第一步，是搞清楚代码在四个区域之间的流转：</p><table><thead><tr><th>区域</th><th>英文</th><th>作用</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>工作区</td><td>Working Directory</td><td>实际编辑文件的目录</td></tr><tr><td>暂存区</td><td>Staging &#x2F; Index</td><td>通过 <code>git add</code> 临时存放待提交改动</td></tr><tr><td>本地仓库</td><td>Local Repository</td><td>通过 <code>git commit</code> 保存的版本历史</td></tr><tr><td>远程仓库</td><td>Remote Repository</td><td>托管在 GitHub 上的仓库，通过 <code>push</code> &#x2F; <code>pull</code> 同步</td></tr></tbody></table><p>一条完整的提交流转链路：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">工作区 --git add--&gt; 暂存区 --git commit--&gt; 本地仓库 --git push--&gt; 远程仓库</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>对应反向操作：<code>git pull</code> 拉取远程更新，<code>git fetch</code> 只拉取不合并。</p><h2 id="二、初始化与克隆"><a href="#二、初始化与克隆" class="headerlink" title="二、初始化与克隆"></a>二、初始化与克隆</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 在当前目录初始化本地仓库（生成隐藏的 .git 文件夹）</span></span><br><span class="line">git init</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 克隆远程仓库到本地</span></span><br><span class="line">git <span class="built_in">clone</span> &lt;仓库地址&gt;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 克隆并重命名本地文件夹</span></span><br><span class="line">git <span class="built_in">clone</span> &lt;仓库地址&gt; &lt;本地文件夹名&gt;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 克隆包含子模块的项目，同时初始化子模块</span></span><br><span class="line">git <span class="built_in">clone</span> &lt;仓库地址&gt; --recurse-submodules</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="三、基础操作：添加与提交"><a href="#三、基础操作：添加与提交" class="headerlink" title="三、基础操作：添加与提交"></a>三、基础操作：添加与提交</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 查看当前仓库状态（最常用，能看到改动所在区域）</span></span><br><span class="line">git status</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 添加单个文件到暂存区</span></span><br><span class="line">git add &lt;文件名&gt;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 添加多个文件</span></span><br><span class="line">git add &lt;文件1&gt; &lt;文件2&gt;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 添加当前目录所有改动（新增/修改，不包含删除）</span></span><br><span class="line">git add .</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 添加所有变更（包含删除的文件）</span></span><br><span class="line">git add -A</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 交互式添加，可逐块选择部分修改</span></span><br><span class="line">git add -p</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 把暂存区内容提交到本地仓库</span></span><br><span class="line">git commit -m <span class="string">&quot;&lt;提交备注&gt;&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 跳过暂存直接提交已跟踪文件（相当于 add . + commit）</span></span><br><span class="line">git commit -a -m <span class="string">&quot;&lt;备注&gt;&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 修改上一次提交的备注（仅限尚未 push 的提交）</span></span><br><span class="line">git commit --amend -m <span class="string">&quot;&lt;新备注&gt;&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><div class="note warning flat"><p><code>git commit --amend</code> 会改写提交历史。如果该提交已经推送到远程，再次推送需要强制推送，多人协作的集成分支上不要这样做。</p></div><h2 id="四、对比差异"><a href="#四、对比差异" class="headerlink" title="四、对比差异"></a>四、对比差异</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 工作区 vs 暂存区的差异</span></span><br><span class="line">git diff</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 暂存区 vs 本地仓库最新提交的差异</span></span><br><span class="line">git diff --staged</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 两个提交之间对比</span></span><br><span class="line">git diff &lt;commit1&gt; &lt;commit2&gt;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 两个分支之间对比</span></span><br><span class="line">git diff &lt;分支A&gt; &lt;分支B&gt;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="五、查看提交历史"><a href="#五、查看提交历史" class="headerlink" title="五、查看提交历史"></a>五、查看提交历史</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 查看完整提交日志</span></span><br><span class="line">git <span class="built_in">log</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 单行简洁展示</span></span><br><span class="line">git <span class="built_in">log</span> --oneline</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 图形化展示分支走向</span></span><br><span class="line">git <span class="built_in">log</span> --oneline --graph</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 查看最近 n 条记录</span></span><br><span class="line">git <span class="built_in">log</span> -n 5</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 查看某次提交的详细改动</span></span><br><span class="line">git show &lt;commit-id&gt;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 查看文件每一行最后由谁修改（问题追溯）</span></span><br><span class="line">git blame &lt;文件名&gt;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="六、分支管理"><a href="#六、分支管理" class="headerlink" title="六、分支管理"></a>六、分支管理</h2><p>分支是 Git 的核心能力：创建分支时与主库内容一致，在分支上开发不影响主库，完成后再合并。</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 查看本地分支</span></span><br><span class="line">git branch</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 查看本地与远程所有分支</span></span><br><span class="line">git branch -a</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 创建新分支</span></span><br><span class="line">git branch &lt;分支名&gt;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 切换分支（旧写法）</span></span><br><span class="line">git checkout &lt;分支名&gt;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 创建并直接切换到新分支</span></span><br><span class="line">git checkout -b &lt;分支名&gt;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 新版推荐：切换分支</span></span><br><span class="line">git switch &lt;分支名&gt;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 新版推荐：创建并切换</span></span><br><span class="line">git switch -c &lt;新分支名&gt;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 先切到目标分支，再合并指定分支</span></span><br><span class="line">git merge &lt;要合并过来的分支&gt;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 合并时禁止快进，保留一次明确的合并记录</span></span><br><span class="line">git merge --no-ff &lt;分支名&gt;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 删除已合并的本地分支</span></span><br><span class="line">git branch -d &lt;分支名&gt;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 强制删除本地分支（即使未合并）</span></span><br><span class="line">git branch -D &lt;分支名&gt;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 删除远程分支</span></span><br><span class="line">git push origin --delete &lt;分支名&gt;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 重命名当前分支</span></span><br><span class="line">git branch -m &lt;新分支名&gt;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="典型的分支工作流"><a href="#典型的分支工作流" class="headerlink" title="典型的分支工作流"></a>典型的分支工作流</h3><p>实际开发中常见这样一条主线：在 <code>main</code> 上拉功能分支开发新特性，同时拉修复分支处理紧急 bug，各自完成后再合并回主干。</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git checkout -b feature          <span class="comment"># 拉功能分支</span></span><br><span class="line">git commit                       <span class="comment"># 在功能分支上提交</span></span><br><span class="line">git switch main                  <span class="comment"># 切回主干</span></span><br><span class="line">git checkout -b bugfix           <span class="comment"># 拉 bug 修复分支</span></span><br><span class="line">git commit</span><br><span class="line">git switch main</span><br><span class="line">git merge bugfix --no-ff         <span class="comment"># 合并修复，保留合并记录</span></span><br><span class="line">git switch feature</span><br><span class="line">git commit</span><br><span class="line">git switch main</span><br><span class="line">git merge feature --no-ff        <span class="comment"># 合并新功能</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="七、远程仓库协作"><a href="#七、远程仓库协作" class="headerlink" title="七、远程仓库协作"></a>七、远程仓库协作</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 查看远程仓库地址</span></span><br><span class="line">git remote -v</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 添加远程仓库关联（origin 是默认别名）</span></span><br><span class="line">git remote add origin &lt;远程地址&gt;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 修改远程仓库地址</span></span><br><span class="line">git remote set-url origin &lt;新地址&gt;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 删除远程仓库关联</span></span><br><span class="line">git remote remove origin</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 拉取远程最新信息，但不自动合并</span></span><br><span class="line">git fetch</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 拉取并合并（等价于 fetch + merge）</span></span><br><span class="line">git pull</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 以 rebase 方式拉取，避免产生额外的 merge 记录</span></span><br><span class="line">git pull --rebase</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 推送本地分支到远程</span></span><br><span class="line">git push origin &lt;分支名&gt;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 首次推送并建立追踪关系</span></span><br><span class="line">git push -u origin &lt;分支名&gt;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 强制推送（谨慎，会覆盖远程历史）</span></span><br><span class="line">git push -f origin &lt;分支名&gt;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><div class="note warning flat"><p><code>git push -f</code> 会用本地历史覆盖远程。多人共用的主干分支严禁强推；私有分支需要 rebase 整理历史时才使用。</p></div><h2 id="八、暂存改动：stash"><a href="#八、暂存改动：stash" class="headerlink" title="八、暂存改动：stash"></a>八、暂存改动：stash</h2><p>当手头代码开发到一半，却需要临时切分支处理紧急任务时，可以用 <code>stash</code> 把未提交的改动先储藏起来，保持工作区干净。</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 储藏当前所有修改</span></span><br><span class="line">git stash</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 储藏并添加备注</span></span><br><span class="line">git stash save <span class="string">&quot;&lt;备注&gt;&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 查看储藏列表</span></span><br><span class="line">git stash list</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 恢复最近一次储藏，但保留储藏记录</span></span><br><span class="line">git stash apply</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 恢复指定储藏</span></span><br><span class="line">git stash apply stash@&#123;0&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 恢复最近一次储藏并删除该记录</span></span><br><span class="line">git stash pop</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 删除一条储藏</span></span><br><span class="line">git stash drop stash@&#123;0&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 清空所有储藏</span></span><br><span class="line">git stash clear</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="九、撤销与回滚"><a href="#九、撤销与回滚" class="headerlink" title="九、撤销与回滚"></a>九、撤销与回滚</h2><p>根据改动所处的不同阶段，选择对应的撤销方式。</p><h3 id="9-1-撤销工作区-暂存区改动"><a href="#9-1-撤销工作区-暂存区改动" class="headerlink" title="9.1 撤销工作区 &#x2F; 暂存区改动"></a>9.1 撤销工作区 &#x2F; 暂存区改动</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 文件还没 add，撤销工作区修改（旧写法）</span></span><br><span class="line">git checkout -- &lt;文件名&gt;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 新版推荐：撤销工作区修改</span></span><br><span class="line">git restore &lt;文件名&gt;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 文件已经 add，从暂存区撤回到工作区</span></span><br><span class="line">git reset HEAD &lt;文件名&gt;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 新版推荐：从暂存区撤回</span></span><br><span class="line">git restore --staged &lt;文件名&gt;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="9-2-版本回退-reset"><a href="#9-2-版本回退-reset" class="headerlink" title="9.2 版本回退 reset"></a>9.2 版本回退 reset</h3><p><code>reset</code> 用于已经 <code>commit</code> 的情况，三种模式区别在于改动保留的位置：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 软重置：回到指定版本，改动保留在暂存区</span></span><br><span class="line">git reset --soft &lt;commit-id&gt;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 混合重置（默认）：回到指定版本，改动放回工作区</span></span><br><span class="line">git reset --mixed &lt;commit-id&gt;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 硬重置：丢弃所有改动，直接回到该版本（危险）</span></span><br><span class="line">git reset --hard &lt;commit-id&gt;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="9-3-用-revert-撤销某次提交"><a href="#9-3-用-revert-撤销某次提交" class="headerlink" title="9.3 用 revert 撤销某次提交"></a>9.3 用 revert 撤销某次提交</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 生成一条新提交来抵消指定提交的改动，不改变已有历史</span></span><br><span class="line">git revert &lt;commit-id&gt;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="9-4-四种撤销方式对比"><a href="#9-4-四种撤销方式对比" class="headerlink" title="9.4 四种撤销方式对比"></a>9.4 四种撤销方式对比</h3><table><thead><tr><th>操作</th><th>命令</th><th>适用场景</th><th>注意事项</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>丢弃工作区改动</td><td><code>git restore &lt;文件&gt;</code> &#x2F; <code>git reset --hard</code></td><td>修改还未提交，想还原</td><td>改动会被直接舍弃</td></tr><tr><td>版本回退</td><td><code>git reset &lt;commit-id&gt;</code></td><td>回退到某个提交，舍弃其后的提交</td><td>已推送的回退会导致强推，主干禁用</td></tr><tr><td>反向提交</td><td><code>git revert &lt;commit-id&gt;</code></td><td>已推送的提交需要安全撤销</td><td>保留完整历史，适合公共分支</td></tr><tr><td>修改最新提交</td><td><code>git commit --amend</code></td><td>只调整最近一次提交</td><td>仅限未推送，否则需要强推</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="十、标签-tag"><a href="#十、标签-tag" class="headerlink" title="十、标签 tag"></a>十、标签 tag</h2><p>标签通常用于标记正式发布的版本，例如 <code>v1.0.0</code>。</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 创建轻量标签</span></span><br><span class="line">git tag v1.0.0</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 创建带备注的标签</span></span><br><span class="line">git tag -a v1.0.0 -m <span class="string">&quot;版本 1.0&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 查看所有标签</span></span><br><span class="line">git tag</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 推送单个标签到远程</span></span><br><span class="line">git push origin v1.0.0</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 推送所有标签</span></span><br><span class="line">git push origin --tags</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 删除本地标签</span></span><br><span class="line">git tag -d v1.0.0</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 删除远程标签</span></span><br><span class="line">git push origin --delete v1.0.0</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="十一、分支合并策略"><a href="#十一、分支合并策略" class="headerlink" title="十一、分支合并策略"></a>十一、分支合并策略</h2><p>把功能分支合并回主干有三种常见方式，区别在于提交历史的呈现。</p><table><thead><tr><th>合并方式</th><th>提交历史</th><th>优点</th><th>缺点</th><th>适用场景</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>merge</td><td>保留全部提交与 merge 记录</td><td>分支可溯源，历史完整</td><td>多一条 merge 记录</td><td>多人协作、向主干合并</td></tr><tr><td>squash merge</td><td>多条提交压缩成一条 merge 记录</td><td>历史清爽干净</td><td>细粒度提交被合并</td><td>希望主干记录简洁</td></tr><tr><td>rebase</td><td>只有线性提交，无 merge 记录</td><td>历史线性、减少 merge 记录</td><td>必须强制推送</td><td>私有分支整理历史</td></tr></tbody></table><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 普通合并</span></span><br><span class="line">git merge &lt;分支名&gt;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 压缩合并：把分支上的多个提交压成一个</span></span><br><span class="line">git merge --squash &lt;分支名&gt;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 变基：把当前分支的提交嫁接到目标分支末端</span></span><br><span class="line">git rebase &lt;目标分支&gt;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="十二、Pull-Request-与代码评审"><a href="#十二、Pull-Request-与代码评审" class="headerlink" title="十二、Pull Request 与代码评审"></a>十二、Pull Request 与代码评审</h2><p>Pull Request（PR）是 GitHub 上合并代码的标准流程，也是团队做 <strong>Code Review</strong> 的载体。</p><p>完整流程：</p><ol><li>推送功能分支到远程，进入仓库的 <strong>Pull requests</strong> 选项卡</li><li>点击 <strong>New pull request</strong>，选择功能分支合并到主干</li><li>点击 <strong>Create pull request</strong>，填写标题与说明</li><li>评审人在 <strong>Review changes</strong> 中给出三种结论之一：<ul><li><strong>Comment</strong>：仅评论，不决定是否合并</li><li><strong>Approve</strong>：审核通过，同意合并</li><li><strong>Request changes</strong>：要求发起人修改后再提交</li></ul></li><li>无冲突时点击 <strong>Merge pull request</strong>，确认后完成合并</li></ol><p>页面提示 <code>This branch has no conflicts with the base branch</code> 表示可以自动合并；若有冲突则需先解决。</p><h2 id="十三、解决合并冲突"><a href="#十三、解决合并冲突" class="headerlink" title="十三、解决合并冲突"></a>十三、解决合并冲突</h2><h3 id="13-1-内容冲突"><a href="#13-1-内容冲突" class="headerlink" title="13.1 内容冲突"></a>13.1 内容冲突</h3><p>当两个分支修改了<strong>同一文件的同一位置</strong>，Git 无法自动决定保留哪份内容，就会产生冲突。</p><p>命令行合并时的提示：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git merge feature</span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># Auto-merging colors.txt</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># CONFLICT (content): Merge conflict in colors.txt</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># Automatic merge failed; fix conflicts and then commit the result.</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>打开冲突文件，会看到 Git 插入的冲突标记：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt; HEAD</span><br><span class="line">black</span><br><span class="line">=======</span><br><span class="line">pink</span><br><span class="line">&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; feature</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>手动编辑保留最终内容、删除冲突标记后，重新加入暂存并提交：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git add colors.txt</span><br><span class="line">git commit -m <span class="string">&quot;Resolve color file conflict&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="13-2-拉取时冲突"><a href="#13-2-拉取时冲突" class="headerlink" title="13.2 拉取时冲突"></a>13.2 拉取时冲突</h3><p><code>git pull</code> 时若本地改动与远程更新冲突，可先把本地改动 <code>stash</code> 储藏，拉取完成后再 <code>stash pop</code> 还原，此时若仍有冲突，按同样方式手动解决。</p><h3 id="13-3-文件名冲突"><a href="#13-3-文件名冲突" class="headerlink" title="13.3 文件名冲突"></a>13.3 文件名冲突</h3><p>合并中出现文件重命名导致的冲突，可根据实际情况用 <code>git rm</code> 删除多余文件、<code>git add</code> 加入最终保留的文件，再提交完成合并：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git <span class="built_in">rm</span> colors.txt</span><br><span class="line">git add colors_m.txt</span><br><span class="line">git status</span><br><span class="line">git commit</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="十四、Git-LFS"><a href="#十四、Git-LFS" class="headerlink" title="十四、Git LFS"></a>十四、Git LFS</h2><p>普通 Git 不适合推送超过 100 MiB 的大文件。Git LFS（Large File Storage）把大文件内容存放到专用的 LFS 服务器，仓库中只保留一个指针引用。</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 安装并初始化 LFS</span></span><br><span class="line">git lfs install</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 让指定类型的文件交给 LFS 管理</span></span><br><span class="line">git lfs track <span class="string">&quot;*.mp4&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 生成的 .gitattributes 记录了跟踪规则，需要一并提交</span></span><br><span class="line">git add .gitattributes</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="十五、子模块-submodule"><a href="#十五、子模块-submodule" class="headerlink" title="十五、子模块 submodule"></a>十五、子模块 submodule</h2><p>子模块用于在一个仓库中嵌套引用另一个独立仓库。</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 添加子模块</span></span><br><span class="line">git submodule add &lt;仓库地址&gt; &lt;路径&gt;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 初始化子模块</span></span><br><span class="line">git submodule init</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 更新子模块代码</span></span><br><span class="line">git submodule update</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="附：常用命令速查"><a href="#附：常用命令速查" class="headerlink" title="附：常用命令速查"></a>附：常用命令速查</h2><table><thead><tr><th>场景</th><th>命令</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>查看状态</td><td><code>git status</code></td></tr><tr><td>提交全部改动</td><td><code>git add -A &amp;&amp; git commit -m &quot;msg&quot;</code></td></tr><tr><td>查看简洁日志</td><td><code>git log --oneline --graph</code></td></tr><tr><td>新建并切换分支</td><td><code>git switch -c &lt;分支名&gt;</code></td></tr><tr><td>储藏临时改动</td><td><code>git stash</code> &#x2F; <code>git stash pop</code></td></tr><tr><td>安全撤销已推送提交</td><td><code>git revert &lt;commit-id&gt;</code></td></tr><tr><td>首次推送并建立追踪</td><td><code>git push -u origin &lt;分支名&gt;</code></td></tr><tr><td>以 rebase 方式拉取</td><td><code>git pull --rebase</code></td></tr><tr><td>发布版本标签</td><td><code>git tag -a v1.0.0 -m &quot;msg&quot; &amp;&amp; git push origin --tags</code></td></tr></tbody></table><div class="note success flat"><p>命令记不住时，优先用 <code>git status</code> 看当前状态、用 <code>git log --oneline --graph</code> 看分支走向，再决定下一步操作，比死记命令更可靠。</p></div>]]>
    </content>
